      description: "For each edge of a plot in \u0E22.9: road, canal or neighbour, from the city right-of-way map, with the measured right-of-way width and the gap to it. The plot is first snapped to a road within 1.5 m and any part on the right-of-way is cut away; edge indices refer to that buildable outline (buildableRing) and are the ones evaluate_plot takes as overrides.",
